basic structure of html 
declaration --  it tell the type and version(5) of doc to the browser
<!doctype html>

html --  it acts as a root elements
<html> 
    head is used to define title, meta data  and third party 
    <head>
        <title>html page </title>
    </head>
    <body>
        where we will write the actual ocontent of the page
    </body>
 </html>